==Strategy==
None of the enemies here pose too much of a threat to your cats if you have collected all of the [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. Take out the supporting enemies to let [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] get a clean hit in on the boss, which should eat over half of its HP. Cleanup isn't very difficult with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] to eviscerate everyone.

